Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.77,0:00:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}And now, please welcome to The O2 Arena, London — Team World!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.77,0:00:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}现在，伦敦O2体育馆，有请世界队！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:15.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Leading up the players, a two-time champion in his breakout 2026 season,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.65,0:00:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}率先出场的，是在2026年迎来突破、两度夺冠的他，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}including a stunning title run in Hamburg. Welcome Ignacio Buse!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.53,0:00:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}其中包括汉堡站的惊艳夺冠。欢迎布塞！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.53,0:00:29.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}{\fs40}Now on the black court, the Peruvian makes his Laver Cup debut as the Team World alternate.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.53,0:00:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}踏上黑色球场，这位秘鲁人以世界队替补身份首次亮相拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.45,0:00:38.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A two-time champion in 2026, winning at home in Buenos Aires
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.45,0:00:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}2026年两度夺冠：先在主场布宜诺斯艾利斯称王，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:44.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}before lifting the trophy at Queen's Club. Welcome Francisco Cerundolo!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.09,0:00:44.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}又在女王俱乐部捧杯。欢迎塞伦多洛！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.29,0:00:50.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The Argentine star is making his fourth Laver Cup appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.29,0:00:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位阿根廷球星第四次出战拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.65,0:00:58.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A champion in Hong Kong this season, bringing incredible shot-making,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.65,0:00:58.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}本赛季香港站冠军，击球天马行空，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:05.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}creativity and unpredictability to the court. Welcome Alexander Bublik!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.81,0:01:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}充满创造力，让人捉摸不透。欢迎布勃利克！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}He's from Kazakhstan and making his Laver Cup debut.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.29,0:01:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}他来自哈萨克斯坦，首次出战拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:20.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}One of America's most consistent young stars, continuing another stellar season.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:15.69,0:01:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}美国最稳定的年轻球星之一，又一个出色的赛季。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:24.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Welcome to The O2, Brandon Nakashima!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.41,0:01:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}欢迎来到 O2，中岛布兰登！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.77,0:01:31.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Now stepping onto the black court in London for his Team World debut.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.77,0:01:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}踏上伦敦的黑色球场，他首次代表世界队出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}One of the brightest young talents in the game, the Australian Open quarterfinalist
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.21,0:01:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}网坛最耀眼的年轻天才之一，澳网1/4决赛选手、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.53,0:01:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}and a semifinalist in Montreal. Please welcome Learner Tien!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.53,0:01:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}蒙特利尔站半决赛选手。有请勒纳·钱！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.93,0:01:53.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The young American is also making his Laver Cup debut.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.93,0:01:53.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位美国小将同样是首次出战拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:02:02.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A champion in Washington this summer and a Wimbledon quarterfinalist.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.01,0:02:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}今夏华盛顿站冠军，温网1/4决赛选手。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}He's already helped Team World lift the Laver Cup trophy three times.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.17,0:02:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}他已经3次帮助世界队捧起拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:10.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}From the United States, it's Taylor Fritz!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.17,0:02:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}来自美国——弗里茨！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.81,0:02:15.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Back to compete for his sixth Laver Cup appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.81,0:02:15.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}第六次出战拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:25.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A Rotterdam champion this year and an Australian Open quarterfinalist,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.57,0:02:25.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}今年鹿特丹站冠军、澳网1/4决赛选手，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.13,0:02:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}bringing his trademark speed and intensity back to Team World.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.13,0:02:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}把招牌的速度与拼劲带回世界队。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:33.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}From Australia, please welcome Alex de Minaur!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.89,0:02:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}来自澳大利亚，有请德米纳尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.41,0:02:39.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A two-time Laver Cup champion, he's back for his third appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.41,0:02:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}两度随队赢下拉沃尔杯，第三次出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:47.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A swashbuckling net rusher with a booming kick serve
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.93,0:02:47.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}上网凶悍，踢式发球威力十足，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.45,0:02:52.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}and back-to-back US Open champion in 1997 and 1998.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.45,0:02:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}1997、1998年美网两连冠。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:55.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Welcome Patrick Rafter!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.49,0:02:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}欢迎拉夫特！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:03:01.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The Aussie legend returns to Team World as vice-captain.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.17,0:03:01.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位澳洲传奇以副队长身份回到世界队。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.49,0:03:10.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}One of only nine men in history to complete the career Grand Slam.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.49,0:03:10.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}史上仅有9位完成职业全满贯的男子球员之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:14.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The man who led Team World to victory last year.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.97,0:03:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}去年带领世界队夺冠的人。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:19.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}London, please welcome Andre Agassi!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.49,0:03:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}伦敦，有请阿加西！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.49,0:03:27.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The American superstar returns as your Team World captain.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.49,0:03:27.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位美国巨星再度出任世界队队长。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:39.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}London, let's hear it for Team World!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.37,0:03:39.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}伦敦，为世界队欢呼吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:48.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}And now, please welcome to The O2 Arena — Team Europe!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.81,0:03:48.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}现在，O2体育馆，有请欧洲队！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:56.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Leading up the players, this British breakout star produced a sensational run
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.69,0:03:56.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}率先出场的这位英国新星，打出了一段惊艳的征程，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:04:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}all the way to the Wimbledon semifinals. Welcome Arthur Fery!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.57,0:04:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}一路打进温网半决赛。欢迎费里！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.05,0:04:09.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Now at The O2, he makes his Laver Cup debut as the Team Europe alternate.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.05,0:04:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}在 O2，他以欧洲队替补身份首次亮相拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.69,0:04:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}One of Team Europe's most experienced competitors,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.69,0:04:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}欧洲队最有经验的球员之一，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}with six Laver Cup match wins already to his name.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.57,0:04:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}已经在拉沃尔杯拿下6场胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:24.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}From Norway, it's Casper Ruud!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.33,0:04:24.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}来自挪威——鲁德！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.21,0:04:30.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}He's back in blue for an incredible sixth consecutive appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.21,0:04:30.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}他再穿蓝衣，已是连续第六次出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:41.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A champion in Auckland this season, with semifinal runs in Doha and at Roland Garros.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.17,0:04:41.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}本赛季奥克兰站冠军，多哈站和法网都打进半决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:46.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}From Czechia, welcome Jakub Mensik!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.69,0:04:46.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}来自捷克，欢迎门西克！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.13,0:04:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}He's back in blue with Team Europe for his second appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.13,0:04:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}他第二次身披蓝衣为欧洲队出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.05,0:04:59.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}One of the breakthrough players of 2026,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.05,0:04:59.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}2026年的突破之星之一，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:03.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}capturing his maiden ATP title in Marrakech.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.69,0:05:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}在马拉喀什拿下个人首个 ATP 冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.05,0:05:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}From Spain, welcome Rafael Jodar!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.05,0:05:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}来自西班牙，欢迎霍达尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.85,0:05:14.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Now stepping onto the black court for his Laver Cup debut with Team Europe.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.85,0:05:14.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}踏上黑色球场，他首次代表欧洲队出战拉沃尔杯。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The Italian has enjoyed a breakthrough season,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.21,0:05:21.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位意大利人迎来突破赛季，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:26.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}powering his way to his first Grand Slam final at Roland Garros.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.85,0:05:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}一路杀进个人首个大满贯决赛——法网。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Please welcome Flavio Cobolli!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.25,0:05:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}有请科博利！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:36.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}He's back in blue with Team Europe for his second appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.97,0:05:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}他第二次身披蓝衣为欧洲队出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Already a career Grand Slam champion,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}早已完成职业全满贯，
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}{\fs39}the Spanish superstar continues to add extraordinary achievements to his incredible young career.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.97,0:05:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位西班牙巨星还在为年轻的职业生涯不断添上非凡成就。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:55.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}London, make some noise for Carlos Alcaraz!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.01,0:05:55.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}伦敦，为阿尔卡拉斯欢呼吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:06:04.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}{\fs41}A Laver Cup champion in Berlin, he's back in blue for his third appearance with Team Europe.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.81,0:06:04.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}柏林那届拉沃尔杯冠军成员，第三次身披蓝衣为欧洲队出战。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:13.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A two-time Grand Slam champion in 2026, conquering Roland Garros and the US Open,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.61,0:06:13.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}2026年两夺大满贯，征服法网与美网，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:20.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}and a five-time champion with Team Europe. From Germany, say hello to Alexander Zverev!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.77,0:06:20.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}5次随欧洲队夺冠。来自德国，欢迎兹维列夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:28.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Sasha returns to Laver Cup for a record seventh appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.49,0:06:28.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}萨沙第七次出战拉沃尔杯，创下纪录。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.61,0:06:39.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}A four-time Wimbledon semifinalist and winner of 15 combined ATP Tour titles
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.61,0:06:39.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}4次打进温网半决赛，单双打合计15个 ATP 巡回赛冠军，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:45.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}across an outstanding career. London, please welcome back Tim Henman!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.21,0:06:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}生涯辉煌。伦敦，欢迎亨曼回来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:51.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The British tennis legend returns as Team Europe vice-captain.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.85,0:06:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}这位英国网球传奇以欧洲队副队长身份回归。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.97,0:07:03.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The 1983 Roland Garros champion, with 23 singles and 16 doubles titles
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.97,0:07:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}1983年法网冠军，单打23冠、双打16冠，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}across an incredible career spanning two decades.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.53,0:07:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}职业生涯横跨20年。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:11.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}London, please welcome Yannick Noah,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.73,0:07:11.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}伦敦，有请诺阿，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:17.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}leading the blue side for the second time. He's your Team Europe captain!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:11.29,0:07:17.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}第二次率领蓝军。他就是欧洲队队长！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}London, let's hear it one more time for Team Europe!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.57,0:07:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}伦敦，再为欧洲队欢呼一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}Ladies and gentlemen, the Laver Cup is named in honor of Australian Rod Laver,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.41,0:07:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}女士们先生们，拉沃尔杯以澳大利亚人罗德·拉沃尔的名字命名，
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.45,0:07:57.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}who won all four major titles in the same calendar year, in 1962 and 1969.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.45,0:07:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}他在1962年和1969年两度在同一年包揽四大满贯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:08:02.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}The latter remains the only time a man has done so in the Open Era.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.45,0:08:02.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}后一次至今仍是公开赛年代唯一一位做到的男子球员。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}London, please welcome to The O2 Arena — Mr. Rod Laver!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.25,0:08:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\fad(120,120)}伦敦，有请罗德·拉沃尔先生！
